N:different writing to the other 3 tunes.It has no clef, key or time
N:signature or bar at endAnd, other than clef, key, time signatures and
N:double bar added because the program requires them, is as it appears.2-
N:the number is written above the note, which could be either  F or G,
N:but this probably refers to a 2nd-finger G..Frag2 This is the last line
N:of the page with Jacks Lattin at the top.As above re writing which
N:appears to match the above fragment.  This has a clef but nothing else.
N:See notes above re addenda.CGr..
